### Handling Gaps in Data Feed

1. **Fallback Mechanisms**:
   - Implement fallback mechanisms to handle data gaps. For example, use default signal timings if real-time data is unavailable.
   - Define a set of default timings that are safe and effective in the absence of real-time data.

