### Step 1: Define the `SpatialPartition` Class

This class will manage the partitioning of agents into grid cells and provide methods to detect overlaps efficiently.

### Step 2: Implement the Partitioning Logic

The `partition_agents` method will distribute agents into grid cells based on their positions. The `get_grid_cell` method will determine which grid cell an agent belongs to.

### Step 3: Implement Overlap Detection

