### Current Jenkinsfile

Here's a generic example of a Jenkinsfile. We'll assume it looks something like this:

```groovy
pipeline {
    agent any

    stages {
        stage('Checkout') {
            steps {
                git 'https://github.com/your-repo.git'
            }
